Digital Employee Quickstart

This project is a setup scaffold. The digital employee runtime it installs is
Digital Employee (https://github.com/bytefolk/digital-employee),
Copyright 2026 fullstack-ai-infra contributors, distributed under the
Apache License 2.0. This scaffold does not vendor or modify that runtime; the
setup scripts download it at install time into the runtime/ directory.

DingTalk application and robot provisioning is performed through the DingTalk
Workspace CLI (https://github.com/DingTalk-Real-AI/dingtalk-workspace-cli),
which must be installed separately by the operator.
